  "bodyHash": "f21c69f6ecc67693",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/pxRuuuR.png\" width=\"747\" height=\"246\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fsaltywateroriginal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mRKyDfR.png\" width=\"124\" height=\"120\"></a></p>\n<p>摸摸 Floppa 幫我買杯咖啡吧！&nbsp;</p>\n<p>市面上的動畫模組大多改了各種細節，卻忽略了我們最常做的動作——玩家的跳躍動畫。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>現在終於有了：</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>跳躍：</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>行走：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/F7P2sr0.gif\" width=\"517\" height=\"291\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>閒置：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/S8EJoPq.gif\" width=\"517\" height=\"291\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>疾跑：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2emr3Sn.gif\" width=\"517\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>但這個模組的功能可不只於此！</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>掉落：</strong></span></p>\n<p>摔落並受傷會讓您的移動速度略微減慢：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/XhbEJlm.gif\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">從過高處摔落會讓速度減慢更多：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Med4xjc.gif\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>摔落在乾草堆上會完全抵消摔落傷害，但您會短暫無法移動：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gtSz4TL.gif\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">潛水：</span></strong></p>\n<p>在跳躍動畫結束後立即按下空白鍵即可進行潛水，潛水動作可用來抵消高速摔落的懲罰。</p>\n<p>若撞到地面會進行翻滚：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HNh2aSX.gif\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>若撞入水中會浮起游泳：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1r8yCfo.gif\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">鐵餅式跳水：</span></strong></p>\n<p>要使用鐵餅式跳水，需至少掉落 5 個方塊（此時玩家才會開始播放掉落動畫），接著在掉落時按一下空白鍵即可做出該姿勢。（請注意，若已處於潛水狀態則無法使用此動作）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/H3pEGHt.gif\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\"></p>\n<p>鐵餅式跳水其實沒什麼實用價值，但該死的就是很有趣。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>模組內建設定檔，可單獨關閉各項動畫，或是停用特定機制（如摔落速度懲罰）。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>強烈建議搭配第一人稱模組（如 Real Camera Mod）或第三人稱模組（如 Betther Third Person Mod）使用。</p>\n<p>本模組需搭配 Player Animator 使用：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/playeranimator\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/playeranimator</a></p>\n<p>所有專案目前皆位於：</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fsaltywater\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/p1YdKLT.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"95\" height=\"50\"></a></p>\n<p>若您想將本模組用於整合包，或在影片中進行展示，歡迎自由使用。請發送私訊附上連結，以便我也能體驗整合包或觀賞影片。</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">同時別忘了來看看我的其他作品，它們皆著重於沉浸感與適度的真實性，非常歡迎提供任何意見回饋。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/salty-s-realistic-forging\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/YM3h2s3.png\" alt=\"真實鍛造\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pickuptorches\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/FyTh6pm.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simplywalk\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UckeY7D.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sitting\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/S8sFjIk.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/find-the-treasure\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Y37f1GQ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trashbinned\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/I8WXCEp.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CiRnH8e.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/craftingtakestime\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/962260/description_c05e2ade-ee28-45b2-93e5-93859f4a2265.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#169179\">我也製作《Vintage Story》的模組！歡迎在此瀏覽：<a style=\"color:#169179\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmods.vintagestory.at%252flist%252fmod%253fsortby%253dlastreleased%2526sortdir%253ddesc%2526text%253d%2526side%253d%2526userid%253d20368%2526mv%253d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">SaltyWater</a></span></strong></span></p>\n<p>祝好。</p>",
